OL,3,GNEWSAAberfan marks 60 years since coal
OL,4,Atip collapsed on school and homes,
OL,5,Akilling 144 people
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople in Aberfan are remembering the
OL,8,Fdisaster 60 years ago when a coal waste
OL,9,Ftip collapsed on a school and homes
OL,11,FOn 21 October 1966, 116 children and 28
OL,12,Fadults were killed when the colliery
OL,13,Fspoil tip collapsed and engulfed
OL,14,FPantglas Junior School and surrounding
OL,15,Fhouses
OL,17,FOn what was the last day of school
OL,18,Fbefore half term, children were
OL,19,Fsettling down to lessons when tragedy
OL,20,Fstruck
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
