OL,3,GNEWSAAberfan marks 60 years since coal
OL,4,Atip collapsed on school and homes,
OL,5,Akilling 144 people
OL,6,
OL,7,FEmergency services, miners and people
OL,8,Fwho rushed to the village began an
OL,9,Faround-the-clock battle to dig out
OL,10,Fthose trapped by the debris
OL,12,FA prayer and moment of silence will be
OL,13,Fheld at 09:15 to mark the moment, and a
OL,14,Fmale voice choir formed in the
OL,15,Faftermath of the disaster will sing
OL,17,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,18,FPrince of Wales will then join
OL,19,Fsurvivors, bereaved parents and other
OL,20,Fmembers of the community
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
