OL,3,GNEWSAAberfan marks 60 years since coal
OL,4,Atip collapsed on school and homes,
OL,5,Akilling 144 people
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was said to be the late Queen
OL,8,FElizabeth's biggest regret that she
OL,9,Fdidn't visit until eight days after the
OL,10,Fdisaster - she later returned to the
OL,11,Fvillage in Merthyr Tydfil county a
OL,12,Ffurther three times
